    "description": "Ptarmigan is a C# plugin designed to improve quality of life for designers and fabricators working in computational design environments (like Grasshopper/Rhino). It focuses on streamlining and enhancing the parts of the workflow that tend to be repetitive, time-consuming, or just clunky \u2014 especially when it comes to fabrication-oriented processes.",
